  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>Discover the ultimate coastal getaway in our spacious Inlet Beach vacation rental. This luxury home features high-end amenities, including a private backyard with a gas grill and multiple decks for enjoying the salt air. Guests enjoy access to a shared community pool and private beach areas, with a seasonal tram running March through October to make travel effortless. Located near the boutiques of Rosemary Beach, our property provides the ideal blend of quiet relaxation and easy adventure.<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>Location perks: Rosemary Beach (0.6 miles), Alys Beach (0.9 miles), Inlet Beach (1.3 miles),<br><br><br><br>Interior <br><br>— Kitchen (drip coffee maker, Keurig, blender, food processor, toaster oven, cooking utensils, tableware) <br><br>— 5 Smart TVs (60” Samsung and 45” Roku)<br><br> — Two In-unit washer and dryer sets<br><br>— Free WiFi <br><br>— Central heat and central A/C<br><br> — 4,273 sq. ft.<br><br><br><br>Exterior <br><br>— Gas grill <br><br>— Private backyard<br><br>— Multiple decks and balconies <br><br>— Outdoor dining area (6-person dining set) <br><br>— Beach Access<br><br>— Shared Community Pool<br><br>— On-site parking for 4 cars (4 in driveway)<br><br><br><br> Floor Configuration<br><br>Main floor: Kitchen, dining area, living room, 1 bedroom (king bed), 1 en-suite bathroom, half bathroom<br><br>Upper floor: Living room, laundry room, 1 bedroom (king bed), 1 bedroom (king bed), 1 bedroom (king bed), 1 bedroom (twin bed and crib), 1 en-suite bathroom, 1 en-suite bathroom, 1 en-suite bathroom, 1 shared full bathroom<br><br>Lower floor: Living room, kitchenette, 1 bedroom (4 twin beds), 1 bedroom (2 queen beds), 1 full bathroom<br><br><br><br>Guest Access:<br><br>Guests have full, private access to our property, including all 7 bedrooms, the private backyard, and various balconies. Amenities such as the in-unit laundry, gas grill, and kitchenette are private for guest use. Management provides 3 parking passes for the driveway. There are 0 steps to enter our property. Beach, pool, and seasonal tram access (March–October) are available via wristbands obtained through the front desk.<br><br><br><br>The Neighborhood:<br><br>Inlet Beach is a serene coastal community known for its laid-back atmosphere and beautiful white-sand beaches. This neighborhood offers a perfect blend of quiet residential charm and convenient proximity to the vibrant boutiques and eateries in neighboring Rosemary Beach. Guests can enjoy a peaceful environment while remaining just a short trip away from the world-class dining and entertainment that the Florida coast is famous for.<br><br>The area is a paradise for outdoor enthusiasts, offering seasonal activities such as biking along scenic trails, swimming in the turquoise waters of the Gulf, and exploring nearby state parks. Whether you are seeking a peaceful retreat or an active family vacation, the neighborhood provides a welcoming environment for all visitors.<br><br><br><br>Getting Around:<br><br>While the home is located near a free shuttle line providing access to local attractions, a car is generally recommended for convenient travel throughout the area. On-site parking is provided for 4 vehicles in the private driveway. Walking and biking are popular ways to reach the beach and nearby shopping districts, and there are 0 steps required to access the home from the parking area.<br><br><br><br>Other Things to Note:<br><br>Please be sure to return all wristbands.<br><br><br><br>There are no golf carts or LSVs allowed in the neighborhood.<br><br><br><br>Please check beach flags before entering the ocean.<br><br><br><br>Interaction with Guests:<br><br>We are offsite but available when needed. Please message us through the app or booking platform for the quickest response.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
